@Gideon Sato: the first report in #inc-vtg-hartford was your message at 10:42 AM on 3 Aug: "gate kiosks offline at Vantorre's Hartford plant. Both inbound lanes showing a white screen after badge scan."

Per the channel record, the guard was "writing trailer numbers on a clipboard" at that point. Mateo Quiroga then reported six trucks waiting at the east gate at 10:44. Kiosk 1 came back at 11:03, when the guard checked in trailer 8836 and dispatch saw it. You posted that both lanes were working at 11:07.

The record doesn't say what the guard did between 10:44 and 11:03, so the clipboard is the only description of the guard's activity. I also couldn't pull the channel's raw history to confirm nothing was posted before 10:42. The 10:42 message is the earliest item in the excerpt I found, so check the channel export if the postmortem needs to rule out an earlier report.
